The count decline replicates across model families (Figure~\ref{fig:cross_model_count}). BCS effects also replicate: Llama-8B extreme-BCS gaps reach 77--87\% of Qwen3-32B's (Table~\ref{tab:cross_model_bcs}); Gemini~2.5~Flash shows $\Delta = -17.6$\,pp (Appendix~\ref{sec:appendix_cross_model_gemini}). All three models show no NER BCS signal (Table~\ref{tab:cross_model_ner_null}), confirming task asymmetry.

